OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FLabour had refused to support Plaid
OL,8,Fafter demanding extra cash for children
OL,9,Fwith additional learning needs. Plaid
OL,10,Fat the time said it had already offered
OL,11,F#120m over three years.
